%N A400304 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} 4^(k-1) * binomial(n+k,k) * a(n-k).
%F A400304 a(n) ~ c * n! * 4^n * n^(1 + log(5)) / log(5)^n, where c = 0.207213611549107439386671066286749852243837773781363...
%F A400304 From _Seiichi Manyama_, Nov 04 2026: (Start)
%F A400304 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = (1-8*x) * (5*A(x*(1-4*x)) - 4).
%F A400304 a(n) is even for n > 0. (End)
%t A400304 a[0]=1; a[n_]:=a[n]=Sum[4^(k-1) * Binomial[n+k, k]*a[n-k], {k, 1, n}]; Table[a[n], {n, 0, 20}]
